# Python-generated files.
# The directory patterns below are anchored with a leading slash so they only
# match BackEnd/build, BackEnd/dist and BackEnd/wheels. Unanchored, "build/"
# also matched www/build/ - the Stencil output directory holding the compiled
# quill-editor/quill-view components - so the Content Editor's web components
# were silently never committed, and any container image (which only copies
# what is tracked) served an index.html whose component scripts 404'd. The
# panes then rendered nothing, with no error.
__pycache__/
*.py[oc]
/build/
/dist/
/wheels/
*.egg-info

# Virtual environments
.venv

# LLM configuration files (contain API keys)
llms/*
